  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In a star thought Immortal Gu refinement step, pale flame white bones are a fire path immortal material while green beetle water lotuses are a water path immortal material. Fire path dao marks on the bones must match the water path dao marks closely enough for the two materials to fuse into a clear liquid.",
      "chapters": [
        926
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "named-against-water-path",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_star_thought_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Blazing Heaven Demoness adds a trace of fire path dao marks on each fire path immortal material she supplies. The increase is very small, but it accumulates with every immortal material used and ruins the refinement unless the user’s fire path attainment reaches great grandmaster.",
      "chapters": [
        946
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "trace-sabotage",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_blazing_heaven_demoness"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At extreme fire path sensitivity she is remembered as having plotted that way against Fang Yuan before.",
      "chapters": [
        1502
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "trace-sabotage",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Frost ice flame is a fire path immortal material produced in an area of dense ice and snow path dao marks.",
      "chapters": [
        2109
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "opposite-environment-yield",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "res_frost_ice_flame"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Refining fire path Immortal Gu needs a large amount of fire path immortal materials. Fang Yuan’s control over those materials is much lower when his fire path attainment is inferior to refinement path.",
      "chapters": [
        2224
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "needed-for-fire-path-immortal-gu",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bright light glorious ring fire is the heaven flame of the three flames in the world and is a rank nine fire path immortal material. After the sun collapses, fire path resources scatter onto the five regions, and Fang Yuan offers alliance contribution points in treasure yellow heaven for enough fire path immortal materials collected from that rain.",
      "chapters": [
        2278
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
